                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Thank you so much for your thumbs up review and detailed feedback! We really appreciate your compliments regarding personality, customization and charm as this is exactly why we create fun and casual games that you can play with your friends! \n\nAs many MMO's we have always had items in our games you can get easily or rarer ones you have to work and grind for, which can be a challenge. We use the same RNG as any similar MMO and never force players to have to obtain a specific item. We understand that there's always room for improvement, so we are always working on trying to make the game better, based on the time, resources and staff available. AQ3D as also been out of closed beta for over a decade, we are working on updating older areas, quests, items, etc. We definitely never allow players to exploit any glitches, so anyone doing this can be banned. Any bugs/glitches can be reported via the Bug Tracker - artix.com/bugs. \n\nAQ3D is our first cross platform game which has now paved the way for AQWorlds Infinity, which is the cross platform version of AQWorlds. Once this game is released, we will be looking into making other older games such as DragonFable cross platform. Please keep checking AQ3D.com/news, Artix.com and our social media for updates!",
